  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/16> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Martin Luther King Jr. is assassinated in Memphis, Tennessee." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/16> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1968-04-04"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
