  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/17> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Johnson signs the Civil Rights Act of 1968, known as the Fair Housing Act." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/17> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1968-04-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "After A. Philip Randolph threatens a march on Washington, Executive Order 8802 bars discrimination in defense industries with government contracts." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1941-06-25"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
