  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Executive Order 9981 directs equal treatment and opportunity in the armed forces regardless of race." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1948-07-26"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The NAACP's legal campaign against segregated schools culminates in Brown v. Board of Education." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1954"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Rosa Parks is arrested in Montgomery, Alabama, setting off the Montgomery bus boycott." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1955-12-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
