  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "More than sixty ministers meet at Ebenezer Baptist Church in Atlanta and form the Southern Christian Leadership Conference." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/5> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1957-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYearMonth> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Four North Carolina A&T students sit in at a segregated Woolworth's lunch counter in Greensboro; sit-ins spread across the South." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/6> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1960-02-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Students found the Student Nonviolent Coordinating Committee at a conference at Shaw University organized by Ella Baker." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/7> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1960-04"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYearMonth> .
