  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/civil-rights-movement/timeline/8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Thirteen Black and white Freedom Riders leave Washington, D.C., to test the desegregation of interstate bus travel." .
