  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/articles-of-confederation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Articles of Confederation and Perpetual Union" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/articles-of-confederation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/confederation-period> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/articles-of-confederation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/founding-documents-of-the-united-states> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/articles-of-confederation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The first written frame of national government for the United States, adopted by the Second Continental Congress on November 15, 1777, in force from Maryland's ratification on March 1, 1781, until the Constitution replaced it in 1789; it joined sovereign states in a league governed by a one-state, one-vote Congress with no power to tax." .
