  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/declaration-of-independence/timeline/8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "John Hancock and most of the delegates sign the engrossed parchment." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/declaration-of-independence/timeline/8> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1776-08-02"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
