  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/declaration-of-independence> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The statement adopted by the Second Continental Congress on July 4, 1776, announcing that the thirteen American colonies were free and independent states, setting out a philosophy of natural rights and government by consent, and listing grievances against King George III." .
