  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-congress/timeline/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Representative James Madison proposes constitutional amendments on the House floor." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-congress/timeline/5> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1789-06-08"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-congress/timeline/6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-congress/timeline/6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Congress begins a ten-year residence in Philadelphia." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-congress/timeline/6> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1790-12-06"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-congress/timeline/7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-congress/timeline/7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The Senate moves into the unfinished Capitol in Washington, D.C." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-congress/timeline/7> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1800-11-17"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
