  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-congress/timeline/8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "British troops set fire to the Capitol during the War of 1812." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-congress/timeline/8> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1814-08-24"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
