  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-congress> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Congress of the United States" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-congress> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Congress" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-congress> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "U.S. Congress" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-congress> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/federal-government-of-the-united-states> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-congress> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/separation-of-powers> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-congress> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The legislative branch of the U.S. federal government, created by Article I of the Constitution: a two-chamber body made up of the House of Representatives, apportioned among the states by population, and the Senate, with two members per state, which first met in 1789." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-congress> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/scheme/constitution-and-government> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-congress> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "United States Congress" .
