  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-congress> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/constitutional-convention> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-congress> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/great-compromise> .
