  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-constitution> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Constitution of the United States of America" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-constitution> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Constitution of the United States" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-constitution> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Federal Constitution" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-constitution> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "U.S. Constitution" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-constitution> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/founding-documents-of-the-united-states> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/united-states-constitution> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The supreme law of the United States, a four-page charter signed in Philadelphia on September 17, 1787, and ratified in 1788 that created the federal government of three separate branches, divided power between the nation and the states, and has been amended twenty-seven times." .
