  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/department-of-homeland-security/timeline/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Senator Joseph Lieberman introduces S. 1534, an early bill for a homeland security department." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/department-of-homeland-security/timeline/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "2001-10-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/department-of-homeland-security/timeline/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/department-of-homeland-security/timeline/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "President George W. Bush, reversing his earlier position, proposes a Cabinet-level department in an address to the nation." .
