  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/department-of-homeland-security> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The Cabinet-level executive department created by the Homeland Security Act of 2002 after the September 11 attacks, which took effect on January 24, 2003, and combined 22 federal agencies, among them the Customs Service, the Coast Guard, the Secret Service, FEMA, the TSA and the functions of the abolished Immigration and Naturalization Service." .
