  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/jazz> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A form of music created by African American musicians in New Orleans around the turn of the twentieth century, blending blues, ragtime, brass-band and dance traditions with collective and solo improvisation, which spread across the United States and the world through recordings, migration and touring." .
