  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/source/voting-rights-act-of-1965/s7> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> "U.S. Supreme Court opinion (via Justia)" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/source/voting-rights-act-of-1965/s7> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Shelby County v. Holder, 570 U.S. 529 (2013)" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/source/voting-rights-act-of-1965/s7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#Source> .
