  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/voting-rights-act-of-1965/timeline/6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
