  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/plessy-v-ferguson/timeline/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Daniel Desdunes boards a whites-only car on an interstate train in a first test case." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/plessy-v-ferguson/timeline/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1892-02-24"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
