  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/george-washington> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Virginia planter, surveyor and soldier (1732–1799) who commanded the Continental Army in the American Revolutionary War, presided over the Constitutional Convention and served as the first president of the United States (1789–1797), setting many precedents of the office while enslaving hundreds of people at Mount Vernon." .
