  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/thomas-jefferson> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/declaration-of-independence> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/thomas-jefferson> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/election-of-1800> .
