  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/fourteenth-amendment/timeline/13> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The Indian Citizenship Act makes Native Americans U.S. citizens." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/fourteenth-amendment/timeline/13> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1924-06-24"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
