  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/slavery-in-the-united-states> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Chattel slavery in the United States" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/slavery-in-the-united-states> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/african-american-history> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/slavery-in-the-united-states> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/slavery-in-the-americas> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/slavery-in-the-united-states> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The system of hereditary, race-based chattel slavery that held people of African descent, and in the colonial era many Native Americans, as property in the English colonies and the United States from the early 1600s until the Thirteenth Amendment abolished it in 1865." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/slavery-in-the-united-states> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/scheme/society-and-people> .
