  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/source/slavery-in-the-united-states/s9> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> "2026-11-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/source/slavery-in-the-united-states/s9> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> "National Park Service, National Underground Railroad Network to Freedom" .
