  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/pennsylvania/timeline/16> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The Homestead Strike ends in defeat for the steelworkers' union." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/pennsylvania/timeline/16> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1892"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
