  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/pennsylvania/timeline/17> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Pennsylvania produces 60 percent of U.S. steel." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/pennsylvania/timeline/17> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1900"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
