  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/pennsylvania> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A U.S. state on the Lenape (Delaware) homeland, chartered to the Quaker William Penn in 1681, where the Declaration of Independence and the Constitution were written; the first state to pass an emancipation law (1780), the second to ratify the Constitution (December 12, 1787), and an industrial powerhouse of steel, coal, oil and railroads." .
